         H       -1.1528499980       -0.5732799983        1.2837000015
         O       -2.6251999976       -0.2756999985       -0.1654800004
         H       -3.0453400006       -1.1248600003       -0.0094600005
      &END COORD
      &CELL
         ABC 36.0 34.0 33.0
         ALPHA_BETA_GAMMA 90.0 90.0 90.0
