         &MIXING
            ALPHA 0.1
            METHOD DIRECT_P_MIXING
            NBUFFER 15
         &END MIXING
         &DIAGONALIZATION
         &END DIAGONALIZATION
      &END SCF
      &QS
         EPS_DEFAULT 1e-12
         METHOD GPW
      &END QS
      &POISSON
         PERIODIC NONE
         POISSON_SOLVER ANALYTIC
      &END POISSON
      &MGRID
